"The filer uses a set of rules to work out the correct MIME type for each "
"regular file, and then chooses a suitable icon for that type."
msgstr ""
"ROX-Filer是以一众既定规则来对应正确 MIME 类型，并会为每一常规文件的类型，配置"
"一个合适的图标。"

